    "description": "Report 04 S9: a three-voice wavetable phase-modulated by a sine two octaves up, two 200 Hz low-passes in series opened 3 octaves by a 23 ms / 4.2 s envelope, hard 18 dB clipping that spares the lows, a compressor, a reverb. The 17 s decay is a one-shot MSEG on the level (adsr stops at 10 s). Gaps: no noisy detune, no true sub lane (the EQ bell +3 dB at 4.85 kHz and high shelf -6 dB are in).",
